s, NEC\", based in VA, and has been publicly reporting for 2 years.","It reported $13.8bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, down 0.4% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 9.9%.","Listed on NYSE, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 47 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Share count is close to flat (0.8% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011286/000162828026034156/0001628280-26-034156-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-034156"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 0.4% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011286/000162828026034156/0001628280-26-034156-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-034156"},{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 35.5% across 5 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011286/000162828026034156/0001628280-26-034156-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-034156"},{"text":"Gross margin is only 9.9%, so scale has to be enormous before anything reaches the bottom line.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0002011286"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.4% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011286/000201128626000021/0002011286-26-000021-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills ov